      "id": 1,
      "text": "Beulah’s name comes from Isaiah 62:4, a biblical term meaning \"married,\" chosen to replace the earlier, less wholesome name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
